(227,N'State',N'8.22',N'Network Domains By Trust Criticality And Sensitivity',N'OBL-SEG-013',N'Maintain Effective Controls: Network Domains By Trust Criticality And Sensitivity',N'Maintain Network Domains By Trust Criticality And Sensitivity so it equals Implemented and effective (Status) on a continuous basis. Required tolerance: No unapproved gaps. Evidence required: Network Domains By Trust Criticality And Sensitivity record: Current evidence that maintain effective controls: network domains by trust criticality and sensitivity is complete, effective and approved where required.',N'Policy Document',N'Current evidence that maintain effective controls: network domains by trust criticality and sensitivity is complete, effective and approved where required'),
(228,N'State',N'8.23',N'Safe And Appropriate Web-Use Rules',N'OBL-WEB-003',N'Maintain Effective Controls: Safe And Appropriate Web-Use Rules',N'Maintain Safe And Appropriate Web-Use Rules so it equals Implemented and effective (Status) on a continuous basis. Required tolerance: No unapproved gaps. Evidence required: Safe And Appropriate Web-Use Rules record: Current evidence that maintain effective controls: safe and appropriate web-use rules is complete, effective and approved where required.',N'Policy Document',N'Current evidence that maintain effective controls: safe and appropriate web-use rules is complete, effective and approved where required'),
(229,N'State',N'8.23',N'Allowed And Prohibited Website Categories',N'OBL-WEB-013',N'Maintain Effective Controls: Allowed And Prohibited Website Categories',N'Maintain Allowed And Prohibited Website Categories so it equals Implemented and effective (Status) on a continuous basis. Required tolerance: No unapproved gaps. Evidence required: Allowed And Prohibited Website Categories record: Current evidence that maintain effective controls: allowed and prohibited website categories is complete, effective and approved where required.',N'Policy Document',N'Current evidence that maintain effective controls: allowed and prohibited website categories is complete, effective and approved where required'),
(230,N'State',N'8.24',N'Cryptography Policy And Approved Use',N'OBL-CRY-003',N'Maintain Effective Controls: Cryptography Policy And Approved Use',N'Maintain Cryptography Policy And Approved Use so it equals Implemented and effective (Status) on a continuous basis. Required tolerance: No unapproved gaps. Evidence required: Cryptography Policy And Approved Use record: Current evidence that maintain effective controls: cryptography policy and approved use is complete, effective and approved where required.',N'Policy Document',N'Current evidence that maintain effective controls: cryptography policy and approved use is complete, effective and approved where required'),
(231,N'State',N'8.24',N'Information Classification And Protection Strength',N'OBL-CRY-013',N'Maintain Effective Controls: Information Classification And Protection Strength',N'Maintain Information Classification And Protection Strength so it equals Implemented and effective (Status) on a continuous basis. Required tolerance: No unapproved gaps. Evidence required: Information Classification And Protection Strength record: Current evidence that maintain effective controls: information classification and protection strength is complete, effective and approved where required.',N'Policy Document',N'Current evidence that maintain effective controls: information classification and protection strength is complete, effective and approved where required'),
(232,N'State',N'8.25',N'Secure Development Policy And Methodology',N'OBL-SDL-003',N'Maintain Effective Controls: Secure Development Policy And Methodology',N'Maintain Secure Development Policy And Methodology so it equals Implemented and effective (Status) on a continuous basis. Required tolerance: No unapproved gaps. Evidence required: Secure Development Policy And Methodology record: Current evidence that maintain effective controls: secure development policy and methodology is complete, effective and approved where required.',N'Policy Document',N'Current evidence that maintain effective controls: secure development policy and methodology is complete, effective and approved where required'),
(233,N'State',N'8.25',N'Development Test And Production Separation',N'OBL-SDL-013',N'Maintain Effective Controls: Development Test And Production Separation',N'Maintain Development Test And Production Separation so it equals Implemented and effective (Status) on a continuous basis. Required tolerance: No unapproved gaps. Evidence required: Development Test And Production Separation record: Current evidence that maintain effective controls: development test and production separation is complete, effective and approved where required.',N'Policy Document',N'Current evidence that maintain effective controls: development test and production separation is complete, effective and approved where required'),
(234,N'State',N'8.26',N'Application Security Risk Assessment And Approval',N'OBL-APP-003',N'Maintain Effective Controls: Application Security Risk Assessment And Approval',N'Maintain Application Security Risk Assessment And Approval so it equals Implemented and effective (Status) on a continuous basis. Required tolerance: No unapproved gaps. Evidence required: Application Security Risk Assessment And Approval record: Current evidence that maintain effective controls: application security risk assessment and approval is complete, effective and approved where required.',N'Policy Document',N'Current evidence that maintain effective controls: application security risk assessment and approval is complete, effective and approved where required'),
(235,N'State',N'8.26',N'Identity Trust Authentication And Access Segregation',N'OBL-APP-013',N'Maintain Effective Controls: Identity Trust Authentication And Access Segregation',N'Maintain Identity Trust Authentication And Access Segregation so it equals Implemented and effective (Status) on a continuous basis. Required tolerance: No unapproved gaps. Evidence required: Identity Trust Authentication And Access Segregation record: Current evidence that maintain effective controls: identity trust authentication and access segregation is complete, effective and approved where required.',N'Policy Document',N'Current evidence that maintain effective controls: identity trust authentication and access segregation is complete, effective and approved where required'),
(236,N'State',N'8.27',N'Secure Engineering Principles And Governance',N'OBL-ARC-003',N'Maintain Effective Controls: Secure Engineering Principles And Governance',N'Maintain Secure Engineering Principles And Governance so it equals Implemented and effective (Status) on a continuous basis. Required tolerance: No unapproved gaps. Evidence required: Secure Engineering Principles And Governance record: Current evidence that maintain effective controls: secure engineering principles and governance is complete, effective and approved where required.',N'Policy Document',N'Current evidence that maintain effective controls: secure engineering principles and governance is complete, effective and approved where required'),
(237,N'State',N'8.27',N'Security Across Business Data Application And Technology Layers',N'OBL-ARC-013',N'Maintain Effective Controls: Security Across Business Data Application And Technology Layers',N'Maintain Security Across Business Data Application And Technology Layers so it equals Implemented and effective (Status) on a continuous basis. Required tolerance: No unapproved gaps. Evidence required: Security Across Business Data Application And Technology Layers record: Current evidence that maintain effective controls: security across business data application and technology layers is complete, effective and approved where required.',N'Policy Document',N'Current evidence that maintain effective controls: security across business data application and technology layers is complete, effective and approved where required'),
(238,N'State',N'8.28',N'Secure Coding Governance And Minimum Baseline',N'OBL-COD-003',N'Maintain Effective Controls: Secure Coding Governance And Minimum Baseline',N'Maintain Secure Coding Governance And Minimum Baseline so it equals Implemented and effective (Status) on a continuous basis. Required tolerance: No unapproved gaps. Evidence required: Secure Coding Governance And Minimum Baseline record: Current evidence that maintain effective controls: secure coding governance and minimum baseline is complete, effective and approved where required.',N'Policy Document',N'Current evidence that maintain effective controls: secure coding governance and minimum baseline is complete, effective and approved where required'),
(239,N'State',N'8.28',N'Third-Party And Open-Source Component Coverage',N'OBL-COD-013',N'Maintain Effective Controls: Third-Party And Open-Source Component Coverage',N'Maintain Third-Party And Open-Source Component Coverage so it equals Implemented and effective (Status) on a continuous basis. Required tolerance: No unapproved gaps. Evidence required: Third-Party And Open-Source Component Coverage record: Current evidence that maintain effective controls: third-party and open-source component coverage is complete, effective and approved where required.',N'Policy Document',N'Current evidence that maintain effective controls: third-party and open-source component coverage is complete, effective and approved where required'),
(240,N'State',N'8.29',N'Security Testing Process And Requirements',N'OBL-TST-003',N'Maintain Effective Controls: Security Testing Process And Requirements',N'Maintain Security Testing Process And Requirements so it equals Implemented and effective (Status) on a continuous basis. Required tolerance: No unapproved gaps. Evidence required: Security Testing Process And Requirements record: Current evidence that maintain effective controls: security testing process and requirements is complete, effective and approved where required.',N'Policy Document',N'Current evidence that maintain effective controls: security testing process and requirements is complete, effective and approved where required');

INSERT #obl(seq,obl_type,statement_reference,practice_name,sheet_obligation_id,obligation_name,obligation_desc,evidence_type_name,evidence_details) VALUES
(241,N'State',N'8.29',N'New System Upgrade And Version Testing',N'OBL-TST-013',N'Maintain Effective Controls: New System Upgrade And Version Testing',N'Maintain New System Upgrade And Version Testing so it equals Implemented and effective (Status) on a continuous basis. Required tolerance: No unapproved gaps. Evidence required: New System Upgrade And Version Testing record: Current evidence that maintain effective controls: new system upgrade and version testing is complete, effective and approved where required.',N'Policy Document',N'Current evidence that maintain effective controls: new system upgrade and version testing is complete, effective and approved where required'),
(242,N'State',N'8.30',N'Outsourced Development Requirements And Oversight',N'OBL-OSD-003',N'Maintain Effective Controls: Outsourced Development Requirements And Oversight',N'Maintain Outsourced Development Requirements And Oversight so it equals Implemented and effective (Status) on a continuous basis. Required tolerance: No unapproved gaps. Evidence required: Outsourced Development Requirements And Oversight record: Current evidence that maintain effective controls: outsourced development requirements and oversight is complete, effective and approved where required.',N'Policy Document',N'Current evidence that maintain effective controls: outsourced development requirements and oversight is complete, effective and approved where required'),
(243,N'State',N'8.30',N'Licensing Code Ownership And Intellectual Property',N'OBL-OSD-013',N'Maintain Effective Controls: Licensing Code Ownership And Intellectual Property',N'Maintain Licensing Code Ownership And Intellectual Property so it equals Implemented and effective (Status) on a continuous basis. Required tolerance: No unapproved gaps. Evidence required: Licensing Code Ownership And Intellectual Property record: Current evidence that maintain effective controls: licensing code ownership and intellectual property is complete, effective and approved where required.',N'Policy Document',N'Current evidence that maintain effective controls: licensing code ownership and intellectual property is complete, effective and approved where required'),
(244,N'State',N'8.31',N'Environment Separation Requirements And Design',N'OBL-ESEP-003',N'Maintain Effective Controls: Environment Separation Requirements And Design',N'Maintain Environment Separation Requirements And Design so it equals Implemented and effective (Status) on a continuous basis. Required tolerance: No unapproved gaps. Evidence required: Environment Separation Requirements And Design record: Current evidence that maintain effective controls: environment separation requirements and design is complete, effective and approved where required.',N'Policy Document',N'Current evidence that maintain effective controls: environment separation requirements and design is complete, effective and approved where required'),
(245,N'State',N'8.31',N'Separate Development Test And Production Domains',N'OBL-ESEP-013',N'Maintain Effective Controls: Separate Development Test And Production Domains',N'Maintain Separate Development Test And Production Domains so it equals Implemented and effective (Status) on a continuous basis. Required tolerance: No unapproved gaps. Evidence required: Separate Development Test And Production Domains record: Current evidence that maintain effective controls: separate development test and production domains is complete, effective and approved where required.',N'Policy Document',N'Current evidence that maintain effective controls: separate development test and production domains is complete, effective and approved where required'),
(246,N'State',N'8.32',N'Formal Change Policy And Life-Cycle Process',N'OBL-CHG-003',N'Maintain Effective Controls: Formal Change Policy And Life-Cycle Process',N'Maintain Formal Change Policy And Life-Cycle Process so it equals Implemented and effective (Status) on a continuous basis. Required tolerance: No unapproved gaps. Evidence required: Formal Change Policy And Life-Cycle Process record: Current evidence that maintain effective controls: formal change policy and life-cycle process is complete, effective and approved where required.',N'Policy Document',N'Current evidence that maintain effective controls: formal change policy and life-cycle process is complete, effective and approved where required'),
(247,N'State',N'8.32',N'Change Ownership Responsibilities And Procedures',N'OBL-CHG-013',N'Maintain Effective Controls: Change Ownership Responsibilities And Procedures',N'Maintain Change Ownership Responsibilities And Procedures so it equals Implemented and effective (Status) on a continuous basis. Required tolerance: No unapproved gaps. Evidence required: Change Ownership Responsibilities And Procedures record: Current evidence that maintain effective controls: change ownership responsibilities and procedures is complete, effective and approved where required.',N'Policy Document',N'Current evidence that maintain effective controls: change ownership responsibilities and procedures is complete, effective and approved where required'),
(248,N'State',N'8.33',N'Test Information Selection And Reliability',N'OBL-TIN-003',N'Maintain Effective Controls: Test Information Selection And Reliability',N'Maintain Test Information Selection And Reliability so it equals Implemented and effective (Status) on a continuous basis. Required tolerance: No unapproved gaps. Evidence required: Test Information Selection And Reliability record: Current evidence that maintain effective controls: test information selection and reliability is complete, effective and approved where required.',N'Policy Document',N'Current evidence that maintain effective controls: test information selection and reliability is complete, effective and approved where required'),
(249,N'State',N'8.33',N'Sensitive And Personal Data Avoidance',N'OBL-TIN-013',N'Maintain Effective Controls: Sensitive And Personal Data Avoidance',N'Maintain Sensitive And Personal Data Avoidance so it equals Implemented and effective (Status) on a continuous basis. Required tolerance: No unapproved gaps. Evidence required: Sensitive And Personal Data Avoidance record: Current evidence that maintain effective controls: sensitive and personal data avoidance is complete, effective and approved where required.',N'Policy Document',N'Current evidence that maintain effective controls: sensitive and personal data avoidance is complete, effective and approved where required'),
(250,N'State',N'8.34',N'Audit Testing Planning And Management Agreement',N'OBL-ATS-003',N'Maintain Effective Controls: Audit Testing Planning And Management Agreement',N'Maintain Audit Testing Planning And Management Agreement so it equals Implemented and effective (Status) on a continuous basis. Required tolerance: No unapproved gaps. Evidence required: Audit Testing Planning And Management Agreement record: Current evidence that maintain effective controls: audit testing planning and management agreement is complete, effective and approved where required.',N'Policy Document',N'Current evidence that maintain effective controls: audit testing planning and management agreement is complete, effective and approved where required'),
(251,N'State',N'8.34',N'System And Data Access Approval',N'OBL-ATS-013',N'Maintain Effective Controls: System And Data Access Approval',N'Maintain System And Data Access Approval so it equals Implemented and effective (Status) on a continuous basis. Required tolerance: No unapproved gaps. Evidence required: System And Data Access Approval record: Current evidence that maintain effective controls: system and data access approval is complete, effective and approved where required.',N'Policy Document',N'Current evidence that maintain effective controls: system and data access approval is complete, effective and approved where required'),
(252,N'Execution',N'5.1',N'Establish the information security policy',N'OBL-POL-003',N'Consider Business, Legal and Risk Requirements',N'Perform Assess the requirements and risks that must shape the information security policy when Before the policy or a major revision is submitted for approval, led by Information Security with Legal, Compliance and Business Owners, and complete it Before approval. Frequency: When creating or revising the policy. Evidence required: Policy requirements assessment: Business, legal, contractual, risk and threat inputs considered.',N'Policy Document',N'Business, legal, contractual, risk and threat inputs considered'),
(253,N'Execution',N'5.1',N'Maintain topic-specific policies',N'OBL-POL-005',N'Create Required Topic-Specific Policies',N'Perform Create or update a topic-specific policy when detailed mandatory requirements are needed when When risk, law, contract or the control framework identifies a policy need, led by Relevant Policy Owner with Information Security, and complete it Before the related process or control is put into use. Frequency: When a control area needs detailed direction. Evidence required: Approved topic-specific policy: Detailed requirements for the security area and intended users.',N'Policy Document',N'Detailed requirements for the security area and intended users'),
(254,N'Execution',N'5.2',N'Define the security role structure',N'OBL-ROL-002',N'Define Required Information Security Roles',N'Perform Define the roles needed to implement, operate and manage information security when Before the role structure or a material change is approved, led by Information Security Leader with Management, and complete it Before approval. Frequency: When establishing or changing the security organisation. Evidence required: Security role catalogue: Role purpose, responsibilities, authority, reporting line and required competence.',N'Policy Document',N'Role purpose, responsibilities, authority, reporting line and required competence'),
(255,N'Execution',N'5.2',N'Allocate security responsibilities',N'OBL-ROL-005',N'Communicate Assigned Security Responsibilities',N'Perform Communicate the information security responsibilities and authority assigned to the role holder when When a security responsibility is assigned or changed, led by Line Manager or Role Owner, and complete it Before the responsibility becomes effective. Frequency: On assignment or change. Evidence required: Role communication record: Assigned duties, communication date and role-holder acknowledgement.',N'Policy Document',N'Assigned duties, communication date and role-holder acknowledgement'),
(256,N'Execution',N'5.2',N'Allocate security responsibilities',N'OBL-ROL-006',N'Provide Local Security Responsibility Guidance',N'Perform Document additional responsibilities for specific sites or information processing facilities when When central role guidance does not fully address local conditions, led by Site Manager with Information Security, and complete it Before the local activity or facility becomes operational. Frequency: When local conditions require additional detail. Evidence required: Local security responsibility guidance: Site or facility-specific duties, contacts, escalation and approval.',N'Policy Document',N'Site or facility-specific duties, contacts, escalation and approval'),
(257,N'Execution',N'5.3',N'Identify conflicting duties',N'OBL-SOD-002',N'Assess Processes for Conflicting Duties',N'Perform Assess whether one person can initiate, approve, execute or conceal a sensitive activity when When a new process is designed or a material process or role change occurs, led by Process Owner with Information Security, and complete it Before process approval or change implementation. Frequency: During process design and major change. Evidence required: Segregation assessment: Process steps, role assignments, identified conflicts and decisions.',N'Policy Document',N'Process steps, role assignments, identified conflicts and decisions'),
(258,N'Execution',N'5.3',N'Separate critical activities',N'OBL-SOD-005',N'Separate Development, Production and Review Duties',N'Perform Assign conflicting technical and assurance activities to different authorised people when When technical, production or assurance responsibilities are assigned, led by System Owner with Line Manager and Information Security, and complete it Before access or responsibility is granted. Frequency: Before role or access assignment. Evidence required: Role assignment approval: Evidence that development, production administration and independent review duties are separated.',N'Policy Document',N'Evidence that development, production administration and independent review duties are separated'),
(259,N'Execution',N'5.4',N'Set management security expectations',N'OBL-MGT-002',N'Communicate Management Support for Security',N'Perform Communicate management support for security policies, procedures and controls when At the planned annual communication or after a major policy change, led by Executive Management and Line Managers, and complete it Within the approved communication period. Frequency: At least annually and after major policy change. Evidence required: Management communication record: Message, audience, date and security expectations communicated.',N'Policy Document',N'Message, audience, date and security expectations communicated'),
(260,N'Execution',N'5.4',N'Brief personnel before access',N'OBL-MGT-004',N'Brief Personnel on Security Duties Before Access',N'Perform Brief the person on applicable security responsibilities and approved working methods when Before initial access to organisational information or assets, led by Line Manager with System or Information Owner, and complete it Before access is granted. Frequency: Before access is granted. Evidence required: Security responsibility briefing record: Role duties, applicable rules, briefing date and acknowledgement.',N'Policy Document',N'Role duties, applicable rules, briefing date and acknowledgement'),
(261,N'Execution',N'5.5',N'Identify and maintain authority contacts',N'OBL-AUT-002',N'Identify Applicable Authorities',N'Perform Assign Authentication Management Responsibilities when When authentication information is allocated, changed, replaced or withdrawn, led by Identity and Access Management with Information Security, and complete it Before the authentication information becomes effective. Frequency: On allocation or change. Evidence required: Assign Authentication Management Responsibilities record: Record showing that “Assign Authentication Management Responsibilities” is defined, approved or completed as required.',N'Policy Document',N'Business locations, services, incidents and continuity needs considered'),
(262,N'Execution',N'5.5',N'Define authority contact responsibilities / Define reporting triggers and timelines',N'OBL-AUT-005',N'Brief Authorised Contacts',N'Prevent Prohibit Unmanaged Authentication Information within All passwords, PINs, keys, tokens, codes, biometrics and authentication tools in scope. Exceptions are allowed only under: Only a documented, risk-assessed and formally approved exception. This restriction applies continuous. Evidence required: Prohibit Unmanaged Authentication Information record: Record showing that “Prohibit Unmanaged Authentication Information” is defined, approved or completed as required.',N'Policy Document',N'Responsibilities, procedures, approval rules and acknowledgement'),
(263,N'Execution',N'5.6',N'Identify relevant security groups',N'OBL-SIG-002',N'Assess Suitable Security Groups',N'Perform Assess which specialist groups and professional associations can support security needs when During annual review or after a significant technology, service or risk change, led by Information Security with relevant Technical Owners, and complete it By the annual review date or before the changed service begins. Frequency: Annual and after significant change. Evidence required: Security group assessment: Business, technology, sector, location and risk needs considered.',N'Policy Document',N'Business, technology, sector, location and risk needs considered'),
(264,N'Execution',N'5.6',N'Maintain group contacts and participation',N'OBL-SIG-005',N'Maintain Membership and Contact Access',N'Perform Update membership, contact and access information and complete required renewals when When contact details, owner, access or membership term changes, led by Group Liaison Owner, and complete it Before access is needed or membership expires. Frequency: On change and before renewal. Evidence required: Membership maintenance record: Current contacts, access, renewal date, owner and status.',N'Policy Document',N'Current contacts, access, renewal date, owner and status'),
(265,N'Execution',N'5.7',N'Govern threat intelligence',N'OBL-THR-003',N'Define Threat-Intelligence Requirements',N'Perform Define the threat information required to protect the organisation and support decisions when During annual planning or after significant business, technology or threat change, led by Threat-Intelligence Owner with Risk and Security Stakeholders, and complete it Before the collection plan is approved. Frequency: Annual and after significant change. Evidence required: Intelligence requirements record: Stakeholders, decisions supported, priority topics, scope and update need.',N'Policy Document',N'Stakeholders, decisions supported, priority topics, scope and update need'),
(266,N'Execution',N'5.7',N'Cover all intelligence levels',N'OBL-THR-005',N'Produce Strategic Threat Intelligence',N'Perform Analyse high-level threat-landscape changes relevant to organisational strategy and risk when At the planned reporting cycle or when a major threat-landscape change occurs, led by Threat-Intelligence Team or Information Security, and complete it Within the approved reporting cycle. Frequency: Quarterly and on major change. Evidence required: Strategic threat-intelligence report: Changing threat landscape, attacker types, attack types, business relevance and decisions.',N'Policy Document',N'Changing threat landscape, attacker types, attack types, business relevance and decisions'),
(267,N'Execution',N'5.7',N'Cover all intelligence levels',N'OBL-THR-006',N'Produce Tactical Threat Intelligence',N'Perform Analyse attacker methods, tools and technologies relevant to the organisation when At the planned cycle or when material tactics, tools or techniques change, led by Threat-Intelligence or Security Operations, and complete it Within the risk-based analysis period. Frequency: Monthly and as threats change. Evidence required: Tactical threat-intelligence report: Attacker methods, tools, technologies, affected controls and recommended actions.',N'Policy Document',N'Attacker methods, tools, technologies, affected controls and recommended actions'),
(268,N'Execution',N'5.7',N'Cover all intelligence levels',N'OBL-THR-007',N'Produce Operational Threat Intelligence',N'Perform Analyse specific attacks and technical indicators relevant to current operations when When attack information or technical indicators are received or detected, led by Security Operations or Threat-Intelligence Team, and complete it Within the risk-based operational response time. Frequency: Continuous and as attacks emerge. Evidence required: Operational threat-intelligence product: Attack details, technical indicators, affected assets, confidence and response guidance.',N'Policy Document',N'Attack details, technical indicators, affected assets, confidence and response guidance'),
(269,N'Execution',N'5.8',N'Define security requirements',N'OBL-PM-007',N'Document Security Requirements Early',N'Perform Document the security requirements for the project deliverable when Before design approval, led by Business Owner, Project Manager and Information Security, and complete it Before design approval. Frequency: During planning and design. Evidence required: Security requirements record: Approved security requirements with source and acceptance criteria.',N'Policy Document',N'Approved security requirements with source and acceptance criteria'),
(270,N'Execution',N'5.8',N'Define security requirements',N'OBL-PM-008',N'Classify Information and Set Protection Needs',N'Perform Identify project information and define confidentiality, integrity and availability needs when Before information is collected, created or shared, led by Information Owner with Project Manager, and complete it Before information use. Frequency: During planning. Evidence required: Information assessment: Information list, classification, business impact and protection needs.',N'Policy Document',N'Information list, classification, business impact and protection needs'),
(271,N'Execution',N'5.8',N'Manage supplier security',N'OBL-PM-016',N'Assess Supplier Security Before Engagement',N'Perform Assess whether the supplier can meet project security requirements when Before contract award or access approval, led by Procurement with Information Security and Project Manager, and complete it Before supplier engagement. Frequency: Before supplier selection. Evidence required: Supplier security assessment: Completed assessment, risks, conditions and approval.',N'Policy Document',N'Completed assessment, risks, conditions and approval'),
(272,N'Execution',N'5.9',N'Identify information and associated assets',N'OBL-AST-001',N'Identify Organisational Information Assets',N'Perform Identify information created, received, stored, processed or shared by the organisation when When a process, service, system or information set is created or materially changed, led by Business or Information Owner with Asset Management, and complete it Before operational use. Frequency: During process, service and system creation or review. Evidence required: Information asset identification record: Information asset, business use, source, users and responsible function.',N'Policy Document',N'Information asset, business use, source, users and responsible function'),
(273,N'Execution',N'5.9',N'Identify information and associated assets',N'OBL-AST-002',N'Identify Other Associated Assets',N'Perform Identify assets that store, process, transmit, protect or otherwise support organisational information when When an associated asset is acquired, created, transferred or discovered, led by Relevant Asset Management Function, and complete it Before or promptly after operational use begins. Frequency: During asset acquisition, creation or discovery. Evidence required: Associated asset identification record: Asset type, relationship to information or service, location and responsible function.',N'Policy Document',N'Asset type, relationship to information or service, location and responsible function'),
(274,N'Execution',N'5.9',N'Identify information and associated assets',N'OBL-AST-003',N'Determine Asset Information-Security Importance',N'Perform Determine the asset’s importance to information security and organisational operations when When an asset is registered or its use, information or dependency changes materially, led by Asset Owner with Business or Risk Owner, and complete it Before protection decisions are approved. Frequency: At registration and material change. Evidence required: Asset importance assessment: Security importance, business dependency, impact and assessment rationale.',N'Policy Document',N'Security importance, business dependency, impact and assessment rationale'),
(275,N'Execution',N'5.9',N'Maintain suitable asset inventories',N'OBL-AST-007',N'Record Asset Location Where Appropriate',N'Perform Record and update the asset location when location is relevant to security or management when When an asset is registered, moved, hosted elsewhere or its logical location changes, led by Asset Custodian or Inventory Maintainer, and complete it Within the approved inventory-update period. Frequency: At registration and location change. Evidence required: Asset location record: Physical, logical or service location and effective date.',N'Policy Document',N'Physical, logical or service location and effective date'),
(276,N'Execution',N'5.10',N'Establish acceptable-use rules',N'OBL-USE-003',N'Implement Acceptable-Use Rules and Procedures',N'Perform Implement approved acceptable-use rules and handling procedures in relevant working practices and controls when When rules or procedures are approved or materially changed, led by Asset and Process Owners with Information Security, and complete it Before the effective date. Frequency: On approval and change. Evidence required: Acceptable-use implementation record: Rules implemented, affected processes, systems, owners and effective date.',N'Policy Document',N'Rules implemented, affected processes, systems, owners and effective date'),
(277,N'Execution',N'5.10',N'Communicate responsibilities to users',N'OBL-USE-005',N'Communicate Protection and Handling Requirements',N'Perform Communicate applicable protection and handling requirements to personnel and external-party users when When a user joins, receives access or requirements change materially, led by Line Manager or Relationship Owner with Information Security, and complete it Before access or within the approved change-communication period. Frequency: On onboarding, access and material change. Evidence required: Acceptable-use communication record: Requirements communicated, audience, date, version and acknowledgement.',N'Policy Document',N'Requirements communicated, audience, date, version and acknowledgement'),
(278,N'Execution',N'5.11',N'Identify assets to be returned',N'OBL-RET-007',N'Identify All Issued Physical Assets',N'Perform Identify all physical assets owned by or entrusted to the organisation. when Before change or termination, led by Line or Relationship Manager with Asset Management and Information Owner, and complete it Before the effective change or termination date, or within the approved response time. Frequency: Before change or termination. Evidence required: Identify All Issued Physical Assets record: Identify all physical assets owned by or entrusted to the organisation.',N'Policy Document',N'Identify all physical assets owned by or entrusted to the organisation.'),
(279,N'Execution',N'5.11',N'Identify assets to be returned',N'OBL-RET-008',N'Identify All Issued Electronic Assets',N'Perform Identify all electronic assets owned by or entrusted to the organisation. when Before change or termination, led by Line or Relationship Manager with Asset Management and Information Owner, and complete it Before the effective change or termination date, or within the approved response time. Frequency: Before change or termination. Evidence required: Identify All Issued Electronic Assets record: Identify all electronic assets owned by or entrusted to the organisation.',N'Policy Document',N'Identify all electronic assets owned by or entrusted to the organisation.'),
