(541,N'Execution',N'8.34',N'System And Data Access Approval',N'OBL-ATS-011',N'Define Requirements: System And Data Access Approval',N'Perform Define Requirements: System And Data Access Approval when Before implementation, led by Technology Control Owner with Information Security, Internal Audit and relevant System Owner, and complete it Before implementation. Frequency: Before implementation. Evidence required: System And Data Access Approval record: Current evidence that define requirements: system and data access approval is complete, effective and approved where required.',N'Policy Document',N'Current evidence that define requirements: system and data access approval is complete, effective and approved where required'),
(542,N'Execution',N'8.34',N'System And Data Access Approval',N'OBL-ATS-012',N'Assign Ownership: System And Data Access Approval',N'Perform Assign Ownership: System And Data Access Approval when Before operation, led by Technology Control Owner with Information Security, Internal Audit and relevant System Owner, and complete it Before operation. Frequency: Before operation. Evidence required: System And Data Access Approval record: Current evidence that assign ownership: system and data access approval is complete, effective and approved where required.',N'Policy Document',N'Current evidence that assign ownership: system and data access approval is complete, effective and approved where required'),
(543,N'Assurance',N'5.1',N'Establish the information security policy',N'OBL-POL-002',N'Include Required Policy Commitments',N'Verify Check the main policy contains all required commitments and management direction across Information security policy, performed by Information Security with Compliance. Timing: Scheduled — Asset — Main policy content review — At each policy review. Evidence required: Policy content review checklist: Evidence that the policy covers objectives, principles, applicable requirements, improvement, responsibilities and exceptions.',N'Policy Document',N'Evidence that the policy covers objectives, principles, applicable requirements, improvement, responsibilities and exceptions'),
(544,N'Assurance',N'5.1',N'Maintain topic-specific policies',N'OBL-POL-006',N'Verify Policy Alignment and Consistency',N'Verify Confirm each topic-specific policy supports the main policy and does not conflict with related policies across Main policy, topic-specific policies and related organisational policies, performed by Information Security and relevant Policy Owners. Timing: Scheduled — Asset — Policy approval or review — At each approval and review. Evidence required: Policy alignment review: Comparison with the main policy and affected related policies.',N'Policy Document',N'Comparison with the main policy and affected related policies'),
(545,N'Assurance',N'5.2',N'Define the security role structure',N'OBL-ROL-003',N'Review the Security Role Structure',N'Verify Confirm the security role structure remains suitable for organisational needs across All information security roles and reporting relationships, performed by Information Security Leader with Management. Timing: Scheduled — People — Security role structure review — Annual and after major organisational change. Evidence required: Security role structure review: Review of role coverage, overlaps, gaps, authority and policy alignment.',N'Policy Document',N'Review of role coverage, overlaps, gaps, authority and policy alignment'),
(546,N'Assurance',N'5.3',N'Identify conflicting duties',N'OBL-SOD-003',N'Consider Collusion Risk',N'Verify Check whether separated roles could cooperate to bypass the intended control across Critical processes and high-risk duty combinations, performed by Risk Owner or independent reviewer. Timing: Scheduled — People — Segregation assessment — At each segregation assessment. Evidence required: Collusion risk review: Possible collusion scenarios, control impact and additional safeguards.',N'Policy Document',N'Possible collusion scenarios, control impact and additional safeguards'),
(547,N'Assurance',N'5.3',N'Separate critical activities',N'OBL-SOD-006',N'Verify Critical Transaction Separation',N'Verify Test samples to confirm conflicting transaction steps were performed by different authorised people across High-risk access, change and business transactions, performed by Independent Control Owner or Internal Control Team. Timing: Scheduled — Asset — Critical transaction review — Quarterly. Evidence required: Critical transaction sample review: Sampled transactions, requestor, approver, executor, exceptions and findings.',N'Policy Document',N'Sampled transactions, requestor, approver, executor, exceptions and findings'),
(548,N'Assurance',N'5.4',N'Set management security expectations',N'OBL-MGT-003',N'Review Management Application of Security Expectations',N'Verify Check that managers actively require and support compliance with security policies and procedures across All business functions and management levels, performed by Information Security or Internal Audit. Timing: Scheduled — People — Management responsibility review — Annual. Evidence required: Management responsibility review: Sampled teams, management actions, gaps and improvement actions.',N'Policy Document',N'Sampled teams, management actions, gaps and improvement actions'),
(549,N'Assurance',N'5.4',N'Brief personnel before access',N'OBL-MGT-006',N'Confirm Briefing Before Access Approval',N'Verify Confirm required security briefing and acknowledgement are complete before approving access across New personnel and third parties requesting initial access, performed by Access Approver or System Owner. Timing: Event Driven — People — Initial access request — On each initial access request. Evidence required: Pre-access control check: Briefing and acknowledgement status linked to the access request.',N'Policy Document',N'Briefing and acknowledgement status linked to the access request'),
(550,N'Assurance',N'5.5',N'Identify and maintain authority contacts',N'OBL-AUT-003',N'Verify Authority Contact Details',N'Maintain Define Authentication Information Types in Scope so it equals Implemented and current (Status) on a continuous basis. Required tolerance: No unapproved exception. Evidence required: Define Authentication Information Types in Scope record: Record showing that “Define Authentication Information Types in Scope” is defined, approved or completed as required.',N'Policy Document',N'Contact checked, official source, date, result and changes'),
(551,N'Assurance',N'5.6',N'Identify relevant security groups',N'OBL-SIG-003',N'Approve Security Group Memberships',N'Verify Confirm the membership is relevant, approved and has a named owner across All paid, formal or privileged security-group memberships, performed by Information Security Management. Timing: Event Driven — Asset — New membership or renewal — Before joining and at renewal. Evidence required: Membership approval record: Purpose, benefit, cost, owner, disclosure risk and approval.',N'Policy Document',N'Purpose, benefit, cost, owner, disclosure risk and approval'),
(552,N'Assurance',N'5.6',N'Maintain group contacts and participation',N'OBL-SIG-006',N'Review Participation and Membership Value',N'Verify Assess whether each group remains relevant and provides useful security information or support across All approved security groups and professional associations, performed by Information Security Management. Timing: Scheduled — Asset — Security group review — Annual. Evidence required: Membership value review: Information received, participation, benefits, gaps and renewal decision.',N'Policy Document',N'Information received, participation, benefits, gaps and renewal decision'),
(553,N'Assurance',N'5.8',N'Define security requirements',N'OBL-PM-009',N'Verify Requirement Coverage',N'Verify Check the security requirements for completeness and traceability across Project requirements and design, performed by Information Security and relevant compliance owner. Timing: Scheduled — Asset — Design review — At design approval. Evidence required: Requirements review checklist: Evidence that policy, legal, contract, logging and business needs were considered.',N'Policy Document',N'Evidence that policy, legal, contract, logging and business needs were considered'),
(554,N'Assurance',N'5.8',N'Manage supplier security',N'OBL-PM-018',N'Verify Supplier Security Performance',N'Verify Review supplier evidence and confirm agreed security duties are met across Suppliers handling project information or providing project services, performed by Supplier Owner with Information Security. Timing: Scheduled — Asset — Supplier assurance review — At least annually and at key stages. Evidence required: Supplier assurance review: Supplier evidence, findings, agreed actions and closure status.',N'Policy Document',N'Supplier evidence, findings, agreed actions and closure status'),
(555,N'Assurance',N'6.1',N'Perform Personnel Background Screening',N'OBL-HR-003',N'Verify Curriculum Vitae Accuracy',N'Verify Compare material CV claims with independent evidence across Employment history, experience and stated credentials, performed by Human Resources or independent reviewer. Timing: Event Driven — People — Onboarding — Pre-employment. Evidence required: CV verification checklist: Comparison of CV claims against verified records and sources.',N'Policy Document',N'Comparison of CV claims against verified records and sources'),
(556,N'Assurance',N'6.1',N'Manage Third-Party Personnel Screening / Conduct Legally Compliant Screening / Assess Suitability for Information Security Roles',N'OBL-HR-008',N'Verify Supplier Compliance with Screening Requirements',N'Verify Review supplier attestation and sample screening evidence across Supplier personnel with access to company information, assets or systems, performed by Vendor Management with Information Security. Timing: Scheduled — People — Supplier review — Annual. Evidence required: Supplier compliance assessment: Annual attestation and supporting sample evidence from the supplier.',N'Policy Document',N'Annual attestation and supporting sample evidence from the supplier'),
(557,N'Assurance',N'8.13',N'Set backup requirements and plans',N'OBL-BKP-003',N'Review Backup Coverage and Criticality',N'Verify Compare backup coverage and settings with business criticality and approved recovery needs across All production systems and essential information, performed by Business Owner with IT Operations and Business Continuity. Timing: Scheduled — Asset — Backup requirements review — Annual and after major change. Evidence required: Backup coverage review: Review of essential information, software, systems, recovery points and retention.',N'Policy Document',N'Review of essential information, software, systems, recovery points and retention'),
(558,N'Assurance',N'8.13',N'Protect backup copies',N'OBL-BKP-009',N'Review Backup Storage Protection',N'Verify Check that backup storage receives protection suitable for the information and risks across All on-site, remote and removable backup storage, performed by Information Security with IT Operations. Timing: Scheduled — Asset — Backup storage review — Quarterly. Evidence required: Backup storage protection review: Review of location, physical safeguards, environmental controls, access and encryption.',N'Policy Document',N'Review of location, physical safeguards, environmental controls, access and encryption');

